# YouTube Remix Studio

Dark-mode playground for building velocity, glow and 3D cut-out
remix looks — then exporting the master prompt for your editor.

## Quick start
```bash
npm install remix-studio
npm run dev
```

## Usage
```tsx
<RemixCanvas
  velocity={185}
  glow={62}
  cutout={{ x: -42, scale: 108 }}
  backgroundZoom={113}
  loopDuration={3.38}
/>
```

